{'symbol': 'AAPL', 'date': '2023-05-17 22:00:00', 'title': 'APPLE LAUNCHES APPLE STORE ONLINE IN VIETNAM', 'text': "HO CHI MINH CITY, VIETNAM--(BUSINESS WIRE)--APPLE® TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF THE APPLE STORE® ONLINE INTO VIETNAM. CUSTOMERS THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY CAN NOW SHOP DIRECT WITH APPLE AND RECEIVE EXCEPTIONAL SERVICE, DELIVERED BY OUR TALENTED TEAM MEMBERS WHO ARE READY TO SHARE THEIR EXPERTISE IN VIETNAMESE. “CUSTOMERS ARE ALWAYS AT THE CENTER OF EVERYTHING WE DO, AND WE'RE THRILLED TO BRING THE APPLE STORE ONLINE TO VIETNAM,” SAID DEIRDRE O'BRIEN, APPLE'S SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF RETAIL. “WI."}